- **Headroom**: set up by a person, per its page. A session never installs or starts it unasked, never puts `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` in a settings file, even local, never runs `headroom wrap`, `init`, `mcp install`, `learn` or its plugins. No committed file names or reaches it, or reroutes sessions (HR-1); its state and `learn` blocks stay out of git (HR-2/3). → `docs/conventions/headroom.md`
